{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sale Forecasting — API locale",
    "description": "Démarrer FastAPI et MLflow, puis exécuter les dossiers dans l’ordre. POST /train entraîne réellement le modèle depuis les données configurées et attend sa fin. Utiliser un seul processus Uvicorn. Les exemples de prédiction restent dans le même jour pour respecter tout horizon positif. Les assertions de correspondance supposent de conserver les exemples fournis.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 — Disponibilité",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Contrat OpenAPI",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/openapi.json",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "openapi.json"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"Endpoints disponibles\", function () {",
                  "    const paths = pm.response.json().paths;",
                  "    pm.expect(paths[\"/train\"]).to.have.property(\"post\");",
                  "    pm.expect(paths[\"/predict\"]).to.have.property(\"post\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 — Entraînement",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Entraîner et charger le modèle",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/train",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "train"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Aucun corps. Nécessite le CSV et MLflow définis dans config/config.yml. La réponse attend la fin du training. Augmenter ou désactiver le délai de requête dans Postman si nécessaire. Un entraînement déjà en cours renvoie 409 ; un échec renvoie 500."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"Entraînement terminé\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"completed\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 — Prédictions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Prédire une vente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/predict",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "predict"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Nécessite un modèle chargé. Sans modèle, l’API renvoie 503 : exécuter /train.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"rows\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 10,\n      \"store_nbr\": 1,\n      \"family\": \"GROCERY\",\n      \"onpromotion\": 0,\n      \"date\": \"2026-01-01\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"Prévisions associées aux lignes reçues\", function () {",
                  "    const rows = JSON.parse(pm.request.body.raw).rows;",
                  "    const predictions = pm.response.json().predictions;",
                  "    pm.expect(predictions).to.be.an(\"array\").with.lengthOf(rows.length);",
                  "    predictions.forEach(function (prediction, index) {",
                  "        pm.expect(prediction).to.have.all.keys(\"id\", \"customer_id\", \"product\", \"date\", \"sales\");",
                  "        pm.expect(prediction.id).to.eql(rows[index].id);",
                  "        pm.expect(prediction.customer_id).to.eql(rows[index].store_nbr);",
                  "        pm.expect(prediction.product).to.eql(rows[index].family);",
                  "        pm.expect(prediction.date).to.eql(rows[index].date);",
                  "        pm.expect(prediction.sales).to.be.a(\"number\");",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Prédire plusieurs ventes",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
